  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nStill It Runs is a stealth adventure where you play as a cat, alone in a strangely silent house. Collect scattered memories, uncover what once happened here – and try to stay unseen.<p></p>\n<p>In a rundown house tucked away in rural Japan, a lone cat awakens.<br>\nYou are that cat, exploring empty rooms and dark halls.<br>\nWhy are you here?<br>\nWhat happened to the family that once lived in this place?<br>\nWho is the eerie figure stalking you from the shadows?<br>\nCollect fragments of memories to uncover the truth.<br>\nRun. Search. Escape.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Play as a Cat in a Haunting Stealth Adventure</b> – Sneak through a family’s old home, gather items, and piece together their memories. A tense stealth exploration game where every creak can betray your presence.\n</li><li><b>Silent Footsteps, Sudden Threats</b> – Make a noise or panic-run, and something horrifying will stalk you. When the creature locks on, it’s time to escape – don’t get caught.\n</li><li><b>A True Japanese Horror</b> – From acclaimed horror writer <i>Sesuji</i> comes an original tale of loss, memory, and fear. Explore, remember, and survive whatever still lingers in the dark.\n</li></ul>\n",
